#: ../../source/docs/sub-frames.rst:23 e44645fe6e954f0ba826e56b910425e7
msgid ""
"Configurations lacking one or more controllable axes rely on proper CG and "
"ballast to maintain earth-frame stability in that axis."
msgstr "缺少一个或多个可控轴的配置依靠适当的重心和压载来维持该轴在地球坐标系下的稳定性。"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-frames.rst:25 db9e094ed9da482d9506fb923716ec44
msgid ""
"The Vectored frame has a :ref:`MOT_FV_CPLNG_K <MOT_FV_CPLNG_K>` parameter "
"that can be adjusted to limit hydrodynamic coupling between the vertical and"
" (direction-dependent) \"rear\" horizontal thrusters, at the expense of "
"reduced forward/backward thrust capacity while moving quickly up or down."
msgstr ""
"Vectored 机架有一个 :ref:`MOT_FV_CPLNG_K <MOT_FV_CPLNG_K>` "
"参数，可通过调整该参数来限制垂直推进器与（取决于方向的）「后部」水平推进器之间的水动力耦合，代价是在快速上浮或下潜时前进/后退推力能力降低。"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-frames.rst:28 1cd68dfb31a748b089d15ab1e6bb9669
msgid "Frames"
msgstr "机架"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-frames.rst:30 58ec7232c1994aef82a16be414c0d63b
msgid ""
"For reference, the following frame configuration diagrams show rough "
"thruster locations and orientations from a top-down view. Where possible "
"thrusters acting along a shared axis should be set to counter-rotate, to "
"minimise incidental torque generation (e.g. green indicates clockwise "
"propellers, and blue counter-clockwise (or vice-versa))."
msgstr ""
"以下机架配置示意图以俯视视角展示了推进器的大致位置和朝向，供参考。在可能的情况下，沿同一轴线作用的推进器应设置为反向旋转，以尽量减少附带扭矩的产生（例如绿色表示顺时针螺旋桨，蓝色表示逆时针，反之亦然）。"

