msgstr "更改推进器方向"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-frames.rst:78 19d96a2782e54baaa45f3f1fc83d8a51
msgid "Several methods are available:"
msgstr "有以下几种方法可用："

#: ../../source/docs/sub-frames.rst:80 a321c501300544d1885657790f8bf2e0
msgid "If brushless, two of the three motor wires can be swapped"
msgstr "若为无刷电机，可交换三根电机线中的两根"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-frames.rst:81 3f08f50ee8d04b47835ce1288dba4a89
msgid ""
"If BLHeli or AM32 ESC is being used, the motor direction can be reversed "
"using the ESC configurator tool, either by direct connection or using "
"ArduPilot's :ref:`PassThrough Support <common-blheli32-passthru>`"
msgstr ""
"若使用 BLHeli 或 AM32 电调，可通过电调配置工具反转推进器方向，可直接连接或使用 ArduPilot 的 :ref:`直通支持 "
"<common-blheli32-passthru>`"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-frames.rst:82 babdcaf1ad724f75a362204234f64d3a
msgid "The ``MOTx_DIRECTION`` parameters can be changed."
msgstr "可修改 ``MOTx_DIRECTION`` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-frames.rst:83 632d295a4e48440aa8917a26f538d1c7
msgid ""
"The MOTORDETECT mode can be used while at rest underwater to automatically "
"detect and correct the motor direction for bi-directional thrusters. "
"However, this only affects those thrusters which control Roll, Pitch, and/or"
" Yaw axes."
msgstr "可在水下静止时使用 MOTORDETECT 模式自动检测并修正双向推进器的旋转方向。但此操作仅影响控制横滚、俯仰和/或偏航轴的推进器。"

#~ msgid "Green indicates clockwise propeller rotation, Blue, counter-clockwise"
#~ msgstr "绿色表示螺旋桨顺时针旋转，蓝色表示逆时针旋转"
